---
permalink: /help.json
layout: null
---
{%- comment -%}
In-app help map: help key -> docs page and section.

Each page declares the app screens it answers in its front matter:

  help:
    organizer.shop: ""              # top of the page
    organizer.shop.orders: orders   # the "## Orders" section, #orders

The app looks its current screen's key up here and opens `url`.
Key naming and the check script are described in README.md.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign pages = site.pages | sort: "url" -%}
{
  "version": 1,
  "base": {{ site.url | jsonify }},
  "keys": {
{%- assign first = true -%}
{%- for p in pages -%}
{%- if p.help -%}
{%- for pair in p.help -%}
{%- assign url = p.url -%}
{%- if pair[1] and pair[1] != "" -%}{%- assign url = p.url | append: "#" | append: pair[1] -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- unless first %},{% endunless %}
    {{ pair[0] | jsonify }}: { "url": {{ url | jsonify }}, "title": {{ p.title | jsonify }} }
{%- assign first = false -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor %}
  }
}
